#. Tag: title
#: external-command.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Module For External Print Command (&Netscape;-like)"
msgstr "Modul za spoljnje komande štampanja (poput &Netscape;)"

#. Tag: para
#: external-command.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This module allows the print command to be specified completely (&Netscape;-"
"like). An edit line is added in the print dialog for that purpose. Can be "
"used in many cases, for example with a self-made print program."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul omogucava da naredba printanja bude u potpunosti specificirana "
"(&Netscape;-like).Uređivanje linija se dodaje u dijalogu print za tu svrhu. "
"Može se koristiti u mnogim slučajevima, na primjer sa samostalno "
"napravljenim print programom."

#. Tag: title
#: external-command.docbook:10
#, no-c-format
msgid "Overview of provided features"
msgstr "Pregled pruženih karakteristika"

#. Tag: para
#: external-command.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid "Printer management: not supported"
msgstr "Upravljanje štampačima: nije podržano"

#. Tag: para
#: external-command.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "Job management: not supported."
msgstr "Podrška poslovima: nije podržana."

#. Tag: para
#: external-command.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Print options: basic control, depending on your knowledge of the print "
"command"
msgstr ""
"Ispis opcija :osnovna kontrola, zavisi od tvog znanja o komandi printanja."
